OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening with some pleasant evening
OL,7,Fsunshine, then dry overnight with
OL,8,Flengthy clear spells. The odd shower
OL,9,Fdrifting in off the coast cannot be
OL,10,Fruled out. Not as chilly as recent
OL,11,Fnights.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FAnother dry and bright day
OL,14,Fwith lengthy sunny spells Light to
OL,15,Fmoderate easterly winds throughout,
OL,16,Fleading to a cooler feel around the
OL,17,Fcoasts, but turning increasingly humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
